[[2,1,0,"<h2>STRUCTURE</h2><p>The engine lubrication system is shown below.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/33766.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><ul class=\"legend\"><li>1 - Suction head with filter mesh.</li><li>2 - Oil pump.</li><li>3 - Oil filter cartridge.</li><li>4 - Engine oil heat exchanger.</li><li>5 - Main longitudinal channel.</li><li>6 - Sprays.</li><li>7 - Vertical channel (camshaft mounting lubrication).</li><li>9 - Variable valve timing actuation channels.</li><li>9 - Oil falling back into sump.</li><li>10 - Switch for engine oil pressure warning light.</li><li>11 - Counter-rotating shaft channel.</li></ul></figure>"]]